{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "176", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 2", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.07324626196581552, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker (Guide): I'd like to give you some useful information about your visit", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7717311123147541, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "to the stadium today and then we'll start the tour of the areas of the stadium", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7721075839451254, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that are open to visitors. I can see lots of children here today. So, just to let", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7713697118525921, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "moms and dads know a few things before we start, the stadium has lots of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7712607278266975, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "stairs and the players tunnel is very dark. Please don't let your children", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.771456447963511, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "wander off on their own, even for a minute. We don't want any accidents or", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7714694686326442, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "anyone getting frightened. Cameras are permitted everywhere and you can", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.7715872698045659, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "take pictures of your child shooting a penalty. Assistants are helping to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7712825656418579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "organize this and hopefully the queue won't be too long. It's very hot and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7718968951650564, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sunny out on the pitch today. You can get food and drink at the cafe and I", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7711736841409172, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "really recommend the healthy lunch boxes for children. Also in the cafe,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.7713477715124778, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "children are invited to do a football themed drawing. We'll pick the best one", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.7716090050947725, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "at the end of the afternoon. So don't forget to put your name and contact", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7712511930059938, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "details on the back. That way, if you've left the stadium before, then we'll", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3882917173327837, "w": 0.7712827706917655, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "send your prize. But sadly, we can't return drawings. I'd like to mention some", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.40712913948903207, "w": 0.7715656370393131, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "features of the tour. We'll start with the 360 cinema experience, which has", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4259666370880654, "w": 0.7715744541853403, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "been very popular over the years, and then I'll take you to the players", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44495241748105896, "w": 0.7711956244810315, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "dressing rooms. Before going outside to the seating area and the pitch, I", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4637898773586998, "w": 0.7713914471427987, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "should say, if you'd prefer your visit to be self-guided, please collect", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.48265208246982777, "w": 0.7721187591650901, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "headphones from the reception, and then you can listen to the pre-recorded", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5016379005842139, "w": 0.7721606918711963, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "information at your own speed. We've only just introduced this feature and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5204753604618547, "w": 0.7715002261187857, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "would appreciate your feedback. We're thinking of offering tours in other", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5393128203394956, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "languages in future. So, if you have any thoughts on that, we'd welcome", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5582986384538816, "w": 0.7715937288766556, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "those, too. If you plan to return another time, you might like to book one of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5771360983315225, "w": 0.7712171547213306, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "our VIP tours. We've only just started offering these and they can be booked", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5959735582091633, "w": 0.7715655345143593, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "online.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6148110558081967, "w": 0.07744620951404915, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker (Guide): Now the stadium you see today was built in 1989 as part of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6526343338002236, "w": 0.7719684575828122, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "a three-year redevelopment project. While that project was going on, the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6715088360853101, "w": 0.7715491305217506, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "team had to play its matches at the ground of another club. Apart from that,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6904946164783037, "w": 0.7715872698045659, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the club has been here on this site since 1870. As some of you may know,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7093321517987295, "w": 0.7721583337972587, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that was the start of a really important decade in the history of football in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7281696116763704, "w": 0.7714347126733043, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "this country. For example, 1870 was also the year that football teams started", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7470070715540112, "w": 0.771630842909933, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to include a player whose role it was to guard the goal. It's hard to imagine", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7659929273897897, "w": 0.7714783883036251, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "what the game must have been like without someone in that position, isn't", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7848303872674306, "w": 0.7716487847768488, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it? In 1872 and 73, many other clubs were established both here and abroad.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8036678471450714, "w": 0.7715875773794273, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "And the following year, in 1874, referees were allowed to send players off if", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.822653627538065, "w": 0.7716960487805529, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "they committed certain offenses. And also in that year, teams started having", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8414910874157059, "w": 0.7720007529432608, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to swap ends at Halime. One fact I was interested to discover was that in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8603532925268339, "w": 0.771347668987524, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "early football games, the aim was for the scorer to get the ball between two", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8791907524044748, "w": 0.7715875773794273, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "flag posts and later between sticks joined at the top with a piece of tape. In", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8981765327974682, "w": 0.7722074432501312, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1875, that tape was replaced with the solid crossbar that be familiar with", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9170139926751091, "w": 0.7716091076197263, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "today. 1877 saw the founding of further new clubs and the history books tell", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.935851527995535, "w": 0.7715874748544735, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}